sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Two-phase commit call sequence
    accDescr: The coordinator asks both shards to prepare. Each shard votes yes, so the coordinator sends commit and waits for acknowledgements. A no vote would instead make the coordinator send abort.
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant A as Shard A
    participant B as Shard B

    C->>A: Prepare
    C->>B: Prepare
    A-->>C: Yes, ready
    B-->>C: Yes, ready
    Note over C,B: All participants are prepared
    C->>A: Commit
    C->>B: Commit
    A-->>C: Committed
    B-->>C: Committed
